   "id": 495630,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Use the recursive EMA formula with <span data-math=\"α=0.6\"></span> to smooth the time series found in <a href=\"https://openstax.org/r/spreadsheetsd1j\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">USATemps1961-2023.csv</a>, and then use the EMA model to forecast the next value of the series.",
